<title>HUNGARY: CESI INDEX FALLS, ENDS AT 1,508.45 POINTS.</title>
<headline>CESI INDEX FALLS, ENDS AT 1,508.45 POINTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index fell 32.90 points or 2.13 percent to end at 1,508.45 points on Monday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index reflects trends of 72 Hungarian, Polish, Czech, Slovak and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040.</p>
